[{"title":"童丱须知 舅姑篇","author":"史浩","text":"女子年既笄，出适乃从夫。\n从夫始曰妇，将以事舅姑。\n舅姑生男儿，鼓舞更忻愉。\n禀受胚胎成，身体洎发肤。\n玩之如美玉，宝之如明珠。\n觊其能立身，孝养勤朝晡。\n岂知壮有室，却使失欢娱。\n妇既恣狼戾，夫亦与之俱。\n翁妪有憎恶，导夫起嗟吁。\n叔妹有异胞，俾夫肆欺诬。\n及其享富贵，却云夫自图。\n珍异私帑积，赀产别籍拘。\n不念翁与妪，生尔夫之躯。\n不念叔与妹，尔夫当友于。\n动辄生离间，岂不负心乎。\n天殃或人祸，舍尔其谁诛。\n我有为妇法，尔其听而孚。\n凡事舅姑礼，与事亲无殊。\n唯当辅君子，相勉以相须。\n定省问安否，温凊视衣襦。\n俎豆奉燕乐，几杖供扶持。\n出因侍坐席，入则临庖厨。\n亲意或欲与，承命惟所需。\n不作曾元养，问有必曰无。\n亲意所爱敬，率行不敢渝。\n当以内则篇，终身为范模。\n其有疾病时，忧惶问医巫。\n不眠衣带敝，不食形容枯。\n药饵必自试，宁敢离须臾。\n以至复初后，吾身方得苏。\n其有贫困时，四壁立家徒。\n夫既日负米，不惮涉崎岖。\n妇亦悯其劳，推食盈盘盂。\n质贷如已尽，素手居穷途。\n每务宽慈抱，何尝使向隅。\n以其所以养，粗粝成甘腴。\n亲怒我勿怨，亲肥我独臞。\n忘饥日反哺，岂不见慈乌。\n亲既感尔孝，祝尔多英雏。\n佗日尔有妇，复与尔同符。\n因知妇行孝，乃自立根株。\n出尔反乎尔，曾不差锱铢。\n当时奉翁妪，后效收桑榆。\n时哉不可失，作诗劝踟蹰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16512,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 叔妹篇","author":"史浩","text":"妇欲事舅姑，先当和叔妹。\n叔妹不我和，舅姑生怨憝。\n伯叔贵依义，崇恩胡可废。\n晨昏同问安，致敬敛身退。\n语笑不妄发，正色绝冶态。\n夜行必以烛，相遇毋盼睐。\n女妹贵亲昵，唯当尽恩爱。\n椸枷混衣裳，妆奁同粉黛。\n威仪俾娴习，纫缝勤教诲。\n其间有过差，识性须忍耐。\n伯叔各生子，嬉戏鱼同队。\n切勿分彼己，爱犹我儿辈。\n姊妹或归宁，亲戚无阻碍。\n童稚既抚存，仆妾亦下逮。\n彼于父母前，岂不知欣戴。\n遂使高堂言，吾子得贤配。\n推此厚族党，睦姻居外内。\n心期在阴德，施惠每韬晦。\n丧葬乏资财，男女未婚对。\n称家之有无，彼必怀感佩。\n岁时馈壶浆，燕享盍簪玳。\n贫富与贵贱，待之宜一槩。\n猗欤行此行，妇德无瑕颣。\n万口并一谈，可贻彤管载。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16513,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 娣姒篇","author":"史浩","text":"兄弟各授室，爰归事夫祖。\n是为叔伯姒，异姓始相聚。\n习气或冰炭，安可一涂取。\n故当专和柔，顺适无违拒。\n彼有妒嫉心，作意相狎侮。\n惟知以善诱，不异鱼相与。\n彼有狼戾心，凌轹猛如虎。\n惟知以理遣，茹刚宜勿吐。\n奴媵工谗谮，间谍多簧鼓。\n婴孩群戏弄，叫啼负冤苦。\n恩怨霎时间，信之诚无补。\n见境勿动怀，表吾中有主。\n子侄无分别，一意思存抚。\n不见北平王，猫尚能相乳。\n财物有通无，寒温均帛缕。\n不见柳河东，数世同门户。\n今人有女儿，不教以规矩。\n唯与婢妾群，曾不师保姆。\n一旦入夫门，骄横不足数。\n长舌为厉阶，牝鸡晨风雨。\n夫既无刚肠，间言遂旁午。\n兄弟若仇雠，有面不相睹。\n异爨或索居，分财或析土。\n同胞谓慈亲，同气谓严父。\n一旦因汝来，各使失依怙。\n我故作是诗，为世开朦瞽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16514,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 臧获篇","author":"史浩","text":"人生贵适意，安佚固有以。\n便嬖足使令，臧获皆率俾。\n婢实居深闺，奴当立阶戺。\n内外傥致严，家法斯尽理。\n怙势以作威，招权自丰己。\n奴或有是人，刑罚不可弛。\n衔冤恣狠傲，妒宠专负恃。\n奴或有是人，斥逐其可已。\n处众能包容，见得思廉耻。\n守分每知足，爱主常归美。\n忠谨辈行服，和柔姊妹喜。\n为之有室家，周旋表终始。\n其或小瑕痹，过误非奸宄。\n第当明戒饬，勿遽施鞭捶。\n其或肆谗间，作意生荆杞。\n第当亲骨肉，不可党奴婢。\n骨肉长聚头，奴婢安可儗。\n凡百御下人，读此味其旨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16515,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 敬天篇","author":"史浩","text":"古者明良会，君臣必敬天。\n小心常翼翼，终日自坤乾。\n雷电彰威怒，星辰是变迁。\n凌兢每寅畏，上帝必垂怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16516,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 传道篇","author":"史浩","text":"帝王学有源，执中以传道。\n塞路排杨墨，逃亲鄙释老。\n大学吾所行，中庸吾所保。\n直下肯承当，后人斯有考。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16517,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 修德篇","author":"史浩","text":"生身天地间，所贵在修德。\n众善既奉行，诸恶当屏息。\n美利世同沾，阴功人不识。\n冥心契上天，享祐无纪极。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16518,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 恤民篇","author":"史浩","text":"主圣臣贤日，勤政在恤民。\n差徭唯务息，赋敛直须均。\n但使皆当富，何忧富却贫。\n孟公仁义说，不取利吾身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16519,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 措刑篇","author":"史浩","text":"尧舜雍熙治，成功在措刑。\n哀矜行法令，钦恤爱生灵。\n若使杀无罪，宁教失不经。\n于公尚阴德，何况是朝廷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16520,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 乐声篇","author":"史浩","text":"乐声表至和，在乎民共乐。\n百姓或怨咨，八音徒振作。\n朝歌商纣擒，煖响奏婴缚。\n四海得欢心，全胜听弦索。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16521,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 忠恕篇","author":"史浩","text":"君子行忠恕，报恩不报仇。\n恩者人善意，一饭亦当酬。\n仇者被迷误，事过何足尤。\n持之久不倦，其心乃休休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16522,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 疏财篇","author":"史浩","text":"人生贵疏财，过富诚多事。\n愚固益其过，贤亦损其志。\n指廪悯人穷，挥金侈上赐。\n万古播清名，谁云能败类。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16523,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 见德篇","author":"史浩","text":"凡人在世间，不晓乘除理。\n非义或得财，扪心未可喜。\n俸禄却萧条，子孙仍委靡。\n更有祸随身，阴谴何时已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16524,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 习尚篇","author":"史浩","text":"习尚从何来，影响由先世。\n好礼必温恭，收书乃文艺。\n初心傥不思，后弊必难制。\n古人约其身，所以裕苗裔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16525,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"茅茨不剪阶三尺，自古唐虞是圣人。\n万乐阿房歌舞地，只消一炬化为尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16526,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"大禹卑宫自一身，能令四海叙彝伦。\n雕墙峻宇垂丕训，更有遗风及后人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16527,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"相国当年葺未央，欲将壮丽奉高皇。\n谁知后裔求增广，万户千门起建章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16528,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"榱题数尺耸高堂，得志吾人正未遑。\n若有贤名并德行，茅茨之下亦风光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16529,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"广厦须增千万间，普令寒士尽欢颜。\n少陵自处知何所，低小茅檐燕往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16530,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"数间破屋洛城中，却有高名振古风。\n寄语纷纷美宅者，安居宁不愧卢仝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16531,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"结庐休与梓人评，此辈唯知侈栋楹。\n身在地方归未得，归来却始悔高明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16532,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 宫室八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"乞身閒退本何图，赐第俄然处帝都。\n报德未忘三捷奏，祈天且办一重炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16533,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"吾皇多暇只观书，田猎游盘一事无。\n北伐日行三十里，何曾异域市名驹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16534,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"为国先须班马政，蓄储专以备兵戎。\n近来贵室豪家子，金勒雕鞍纵侈风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16535,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"文帝却回千里马，项王独爱一名骓。\n乌江不渡骓难逝，细柳徐行马不驰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16536,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"车如流水马如龙，从此诸郎不得封。\n无限外家多败类，独馀马氏著谦恭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16537,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"辎车乘马君王赐，不赏边功即予贤。\n外物何须勤觊望，惟于事业每加鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16538,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"妇人自处只闺房，车马宁须侈闹装。\n莫与他人争富贵，从来俭素足辉光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16539,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"少时常是出无舆，徒步徐行亦当车。\n近日堪嗟随俗变，便无人与也骑驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16540,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"衰残无似一臞儒，圣主恩容帝里居。\n每到传宣陪燕侍，东华门里赐肩舆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16541,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"帘帷聊欲障堂皇，有德何须锦绣光。\n四汉孝文真谊主，殿中只集上书囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16542,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"晋帝当时自不君，却将步障助骄臣。\n石崇不为绿珠死，天谴穷奢故殡身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16543,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"嗜欲煎熬岂有穷，罗屏群幕围香风。\n更添锦绮为华饰，不念寒家四壁空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16544,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"蜗涎苔藓不能除，觅得碑文当壁衣。\n富贵一朝还自恣，尽将锦绣缭墙围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16545,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"庶人屋壁施文绣，贾谊言之太息时。\n不独庶人须禁止，有官君子亦当知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16546,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"帷幕时间奉此身，当知流转会成尘。\n随缘且用遮空壁，莫较敷陈旧与新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16547,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"绢帛鲜华由染工，红花紫草遂收功。\n若教明眼人猜破，始信浮生色是空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16548,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 张设八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"平时败壁旧泥空，芦席将来谩禦风。\n不是君恩令仕进，何因满眼挂青红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16549,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"锦縠绫罗不足贪，无过紫绀与红蓝。\n仁宗一味黄紬被，万古传扬作美谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16550,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"贵家兽炭拥红炉，衾褥重重绮绣铺。\n当念蓬窗饥寒女，一针一缕用工夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16551,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"自古贤人起细微，王章涕泣卧牛衣。\n若还遇主居温燠，勿忘当时处布韦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16552,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"贫家何事苦劳心，终岁经营一布衾。\n男女夫妻同盖覆，依然冰冷过更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16553,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"女子生来享富华，安知门外有寒家。\n风严雪满多僵死，只为无钱买苧麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16554,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"被衣不要大温然，腠理开舒易感寒。\n譬似檐隈生草木，不禁霜雪便彫残。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16555,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"我生自幼识艰难，枕席虽温敢自安。\n安得衾裯无限数，普令天下不忧寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16556,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衾褥八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"梦幻浮华有此身，青毡已旧不须新。\n百年撤手成归计，多少衣衾属别人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16557,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"圣主中扃日湛然，白珩不重只尊贤。\n更于老氏求三宝，慈俭每为天下先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16558,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"异物丛珍品最高，此心不可动纤毫。\n西戎慕义陈方物，太保犹先作旅獒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16559,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"德产精微偏海隅，谁知寸宝可亡虞。\n果闻晋国成功后，垂棘还同合浦珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16560,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"六国精英辇运来，妆成舞殿与歌台。\n金块珠砾今何在，但见阿房满地灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16561,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"文帝勤劳养庆源，力行恭俭为元元。\n后王犹听奸臣奏，独为青骢伐大宛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16562,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"内家嗜好淡无营，天下方知仰圣明。\n唐帝若无倪若水，南方黔首怨鵁鶄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16563,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"人鬼幽明两不关，人生只畏鬼为奸。\n欲知古器从何得，尽出丘陵冢墓间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16564,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 玩好八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"谷粟桑麻不可无，剩求珍玩欲何如。\n道人家具唯清净，不用巾箱巧贮储。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16565,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"葛覃专美后妃贤，浣濯衣裳是所先。\n若使身无恭俭德，金珠镂绘谩新鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16566,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"巧把真珠缕作襦，争奇斗好尽功夫。\n文皇海内多丝帛，只为夫人曳地无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16567,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"织者何人衣者谁，越溪寒女汉宫妃。\n宫妃莫道无青史，马后先传大练衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16568,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"人君风化匪虚文，举动常令天下闻。\n唐帝宫中三浣濯，未如晋武雉裘焚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16569,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"柔桑春茧未登盆，催税公文已在门。\n一口无辜系囚狱，全家号泣动乡村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16570,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其六","author":"史浩","text":"官中催税急如弦，纳中还须陪费钱。\n若有纰疏并糊药，忍看捧血满庭鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16571,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其七","author":"史浩","text":"千梭札札未成端，织了先须纳县官。\n请得却资泥土用，不知机上忍饥寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16572,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 衣服八篇 其八","author":"史浩","text":"蜡屐平生能几两，衣裘粗足莫贪多。\n愚哉富室千箱积，回禄穿窬汝奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16573,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 酒醴八篇 其一","author":"史浩","text":"欢欣歌饮皆从欠，乐极悲哀自此生。\n不见古人成礼处，主宾百拜只三行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16574,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 酒醴八篇 其二","author":"史浩","text":"越主投醪仇可报，商家沈酗自相攻。\n的知此物难多饮，只为邦家作礼容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16575,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 酒醴八篇 其三","author":"史浩","text":"为子孙顺为臣忠，夫妻和睦弟恭兄。\n如何却致彝纶斁，只为贪他酒味醲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16576,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 酒醴八篇 其四","author":"史浩","text":"平日恂恂号古人，三杯才饮乱天真。\n精神愦愦如痴梦，赢得时时病在身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16577,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"童丱须知 酒醴八篇 其五","author":"史浩","text":"酒可忘忧更养神，直须少饮始为真。\n君看阮籍刘伶辈，终为沉酣丧此身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":16578,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]